<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tipsna61"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-04-20</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Statistische Systematik der Wirtschaftszweige in der Europäischen Gemeinschaft (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Statistical classification of economic activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne (NACE Rév. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Saisonbereinigung</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Seasonal adjustment</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Désaisonnalisation</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Employment, domestic concept - quarterly data, thousands persons, not seasonally adjusted</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">Persons in employment are those who, during the reference week, did any work for pay or profit, or were not working but had a job from which they were temporarily absent. Anyone who receives a wage for on-the-job training that involves the production of goods or services is also considered as being in employment. Self-employed and family workers are also included. Employment is measured in number of persons without distinction according to full-time or part-time work. The data are expressed in 1000 persons. The quarterly data are not seasonally adjusted. Data are sourced from National accounts data. The ESA 2010 distinguishes two employment concepts depending on the geographical coverage: resident persons in employment (i.e. the national scope of employment) and employment in resident production units irrespective of the place of residence of the employed person (i.e. domestic scope). The table presents total employment, according to the domestic concept.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Emploi, concept intérieur - données trimestrielles, non désaisonnalisées</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">Les personnes occupées sont les personnes qui, pendant la semaine de référence, ont effectué un travail contre une rémunération ou un profit ou qui n&apos;ont pas travaillé, mais avaient un emploi duquel elles étaient temporairement absentes. Toute personne qui perçoit une rémunération pour une «formation sur le tas» impliquant la production de marchandises ou de services est considérée comme occupée. Les travailleurs indépendants et les travailleurs familiaux sont également inclus dans cette catégorie. L&apos;emploi est mesuré en nombre de personnes sans distinction entre les travailleurs à temps partiel et les travailleurs à temps complet. Les données sont exprimées en milliers de personnes. Les données trimestrielles sont non désaisonnalisées. Les données sont issues des données de la comptabilité nationale. Le SEC 2010 distingue deux concepts en matière d&apos;emploi, selon la couverture géographique: les personnes occupées résidentes (le «concept national» de l&apos;emploi) et l&apos;emploi dans des unités de production résidentes, quel que soit le lieu de résidence de la personne occupée (le «concept intérieur»). Le tableau présente l&apos;emploi total selon le concept intérieur.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Erwerbstätigkeit, Inlandskonzept - vierteljährliche Daten, Nichtsaisonbereinigte Daten</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Erwerbstätige sind Personen, die in der Berichtswoche mindestens eine Stunde lang gegen Entgelt oder zur Erzielung eines Gewinns arbeiteten oder nicht arbeiteten, aber einen Arbeitsplatz hatten, von dem sie vorübergehend abwesend waren. Jeder, der ein Entgelt für die Teilnahme an einer Ausbildung am Arbeitsplatz erhält, die gleichzeitig die Herstellung von Waren oder Dienstleistungen umfasst, ist als erwerbstätig anzusehen. Selbständige und mithelfende Familienangehörige sind ebenfalls inbegriffen. Erwerbstätigkeit wird in Personen gemessen, ohne zwischen Voll- und Teilzeitbeschäftigung zu unterscheiden. Die Daten sind in 1000 Personen gegeben. Die vierteljährlichen Daten sind nichtsaisonbereinigte. Die Angaben stammen aus den Volkswirtschaftlichen Gesamtrechnungen. Je nach geografischer Erfassung unterscheidet das ESVG 2010 zwischen zwei Beschäftigungskonzepten: gebietsansässige Erwerbstätige („nationales“ Beschäftigungskonzept) und Erwerbstätigkeit in gebietsansässigen produzierenden Einheiten („Inlandskonzept“). In der Tabelle wird die Erwerbstätigkeit insgesamt nach dem Inlandskonzept dargestellt.</dct:description><dct:identifier>tipsna61</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsna61"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/NACE_R2" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Statistische Systematik der Wirtschaftszweige in der Europäischen Gemeinschaft (NACE Rev. 2)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Statistical classification of economic activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne (NACE Rév. 2)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/NA_ITEM" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/S_ADJ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Saisonbereinigung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Seasonal adjustment</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Désaisonnalisation</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=THS_PER"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Tausend Personen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Thousand persons</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Milliers de personnes</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">81</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-05-19</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/QUARTERLY"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">1995-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-03-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsna61"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsna61</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/tipsna60_esms.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsna61"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/tipsna60_esms.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/tipsna60_esms.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsna61"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/tipsna60_esms.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/xml"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tipsna61/default/table"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Table, graphs and map visualizations are also available.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Des visualisations sous forme de tableau, graphique et carte géographique sont aussi disponibles.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Tabellen, Grafiken und geografische Darstellungen sind ebenfalls verfügbar.</dct:title><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tipsna61/default/table"/><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/VISUALIZATION"/><dct:license rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/><dct:rights rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/></dcat:Distribution></dcat:distribution><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsna61?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Download dataset in TSV format</dct:title><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/DOWNLOADABLE_FILE"/><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsna61?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dcat:downloadURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/tipsna61?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dct:compressformat><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GZIP"/></dct:compressformat><dct:format><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/TSV"/></dct:format><dcat:mediaType rdf:re